# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> (inheres in at all times)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "inheres-in_at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "inheresInAt")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/051-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "b inheres_in c at t =Def. b is a dependent continuant & c is an independent continuant that is not a spatial region & b s-depends_on c at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [051-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "BFO 2 Reference: Inherence is a subrelation of s-depends_on which holds between a dependent continuant and an independent continuant that is not a spatial region. Since dependent continuants cannot migrate from one independent continuant bearer to another, it follows that if b s-depends_on independent continuant c at some time, then b s-depends_on c at all times at which a exists. Inherence is in this sense redundantly time-indexed.For example, consider the particular instance of openness inhering in my mouth at t as I prepare to take a bite out of a donut, followed by a closedness at t+1 when I bite the donut and start chewing. The openness instance is then shortlived, and to say that it s-depends_on my mouth at all times at which this openness exists, means: at all times during this short life. Every time you make a fist, you make a new (instance of the universal) fist. (Every time your hand has the fist-shaped quality, there is created a new instance of the universal fist-shaped quality.)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance-level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'inheres in at all times@en' is: forall(t) exists_at(x,t) -> exists_at(y,t) and 'inheres in@en(x,y,t)'.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "BFO2 Reference: independent continuant that is not a spatial region")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "BFO2 Reference: specifically dependent continuant")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/051-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "(iff (inheresInAt a b t) (and (DependentContinuant a) (IndependentContinuant b) (not (SpatialRegion b)) (specificallyDependsOnAt a b t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [051-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> "inheres in at all times"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/517>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000020>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/518>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000004> ObjectComplementOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000006>)))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> (realized in)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "realized-in")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "realizedIn")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "[copied from inverse property 'realizes'] to say that b realizes c at t is to assert that there is some material entity d & b is a process which has participant d at t & c is a disposition or role of which d is bearer_of at t& the type instantiated by b is correlated with the type instantiated by c. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [059-003])")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/106-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "if a realizable entity b is realized in a process p, then p stands in the has_participant relation to the bearer of b. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [106-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/106-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "(forall (x y z t) (if (and (RealizableEntity x) (Process y) (realizesAt y x t) (bearerOfAt z x t)) (hasParticipantAt y z t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [106-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> "realized in"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/157>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/156>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> (realizes)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> "realizes")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> "realizes")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/059-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> "to say that b realizes c at t is to assert that there is some material entity d & b is a process which has participant d at t & c is a disposition or role of which d is bearer_of at t& the type instantiated by b is correlated with the type instantiated by c. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [059-003])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/059-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> "(forall (x y t) (if (realizesAt x y t) (and (Process x) (or (Disposition y) (Role y)) (exists (z) (and (MaterialEntity z) (hasParticipantAt x z t) (bearerOfAt z y t)))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [059-003] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> "realizes"@en)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/156>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/157>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000055> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> (participates in at some time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "participates-in_st")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "participatesInAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "[copied from inverse property 'has participant at some time'] Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'has participant at some time@en' is: exists t,  exists_at(x,t) & exists_at(y,t) & 'has participant@en'(x,y,t)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "[copied from inverse property 'has participant at some time'] BFO 2 Reference: Spatial regions do not participate in processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "[copied from inverse property 'has participant at some time'] BFO2 Reference: independent continuant that is not a spatial region, specifically dependent continuant, generically dependent continuant")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "[copied from inverse property 'has participant at some time'] BFO2 Reference: process")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "[copied from inverse property 'has participant at some time'] has_participant is an instance-level relation between a process, a continuant, and a temporal region at which the continuant participates in some way in the process. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [086-003])")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> "participates in at some time"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/538>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> ObjectComplementOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000006>)))
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/537>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000056> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> (has participant at some time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "has-participant_st")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "hasParticipantAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "BFO 2 Reference: Spatial regions do not participate in processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'has participant at some time@en' is: exists t,  exists_at(x,t) & exists_at(y,t) & 'has participant@en'(x,y,t)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "BFO2 Reference: independent continuant that is not a spatial region, specifically dependent continuant, generically dependent continuant")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "BFO2 Reference: process")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/086-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "has_participant is an instance-level relation between a process, a continuant, and a temporal region at which the continuant participates in some way in the process. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [086-003])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/091-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "if b has_participant c at t & c is a generically dependent continuant, then there is some independent continuant that is not a spatial region d, and which is such that c g-depends on d at t & b s-depends_on d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [091-003])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/090-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "if b has_participant c at t & c is a specifically dependent continuant, then there is some independent continuant that is not a spatial region d, c s-depends_on d at t & b s-depends_on d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [090-003])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/087-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "if b has_participant c at t then b is an occurrent. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [087-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/089-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "if b has_participant c at t then c exists at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [089-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/088-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "if b has_participant c at t then c is a continuant. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [088-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/091-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "(forall (x y t) (if (and (hasParticipantAt x y t) (GenericallyDependentContinuant y)) (exists (z) (and (IndependentContinuant z) (not (SpatialRegion z)) (genericallyDependsOn y z t) (specificallyDependsOnAt x z t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [091-003] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/090-003>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "(forall (x y t) (if (and (hasParticipantAt x y t) (SpecificallyDependentContinuant y)) (exists (z) (and (IndependentContinuant z) (not (SpatialRegion z)) (specificallyDependsOnAt x z t) (specificallyDependsOnAt y z t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [090-003] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/088-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "(forall (x y t) (if (hasParticipantAt x y t) (Continuant y))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [088-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/087-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "(forall (x y t) (if (hasParticipantAt x y t) (Occurrent x))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [087-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/089-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "(forall (x y t) (if (hasParticipantAt x y t) (existsAt y t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [089-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> "has participant at some time"@en)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/537>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/538>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000057> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002> ObjectComplementOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000006>)))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> (concretized by at some time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "concretized-by_st")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "[copied from inverse property 'concretizes at some time'] You may concretize a piece of software by installing it in your computer")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "[copied from inverse property 'concretizes at some time'] You may concretize a recipe that you find in a cookbook by turning it into a plan which exists as a realizable dependent continuant in your head.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "[copied from inverse property 'concretizes at some time'] you may concretize a poem as a pattern of memory traces in your head")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "[copied from inverse property 'concretizes at some time'] Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'concretizes at some time@en' is: exists t,  exists_at(x,t) & exists_at(y,t) & 'concretizes@en'(x,y,t)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "[copied from inverse property 'concretizes at some time'] b concretizes c at t means: b is a specifically dependent continuant & c is a generically dependent continuant & for some independent continuant that is not a spatial region d, b s-depends_on d at t & c g-depends on d at t & if c migrates from bearer d to another bearer e than a copy of b will be created in e. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [075-002])")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> "concretized by at some time"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/534>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000031>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/533>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000058> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000020>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> (concretizes at some time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "concretizes_st")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "concretizesAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "You may concretize a piece of software by installing it in your computer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "You may concretize a recipe that you find in a cookbook by turning it into a plan which exists as a realizable dependent continuant in your head."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "you may concretize a poem as a pattern of memory traces in your head"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'concretizes at some time@en' is: exists t,  exists_at(x,t) & exists_at(y,t) & 'concretizes@en'(x,y,t)")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/075-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "b concretizes c at t means: b is a specifically dependent continuant & c is a generically dependent continuant & for some independent continuant that is not a spatial region d, b s-depends_on d at t & c g-depends on d at t & if c migrates from bearer d to another bearer e than a copy of b will be created in e. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [075-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/076-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "if b g-depends on c at some time t, then there is some d, such that d concretizes b at t and d s-depends_on c at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [076-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/075-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "(forall (x y t) (if (concretizesAt x y t) (and (SpecificallyDependentContinuant x) (GenericallyDependentContinuant y) (exists (z) (and (IndependentContinuant z) (specificallyDependsOnAt x z t) (genericallyDependsOnAt y z t)))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [075-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/076-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "(forall (x y t) (if (genericallyDependsOnAt x y t) (exists (z) (and (concretizesAt z x t) (specificallyDependsOnAt z y t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [076-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> "concretizes at some time"@en)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/533>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000020>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/534>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000059> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000031>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> (occurs in)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> "occurs-in")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> "occursIn")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CVDO_0000533> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> "CVDO adds the property chain that if A occurs_in B and B located_in_at_all_times C, then A occurs_in C. This is used for a few inferences in the ontology, but CVDO can be used without problem without this property chain."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> "b occurs_in c =def b is a process and c is a material entity or immaterial entity& there exists a spatiotemporal region r and b occupies_spatiotemporal_region r.& forall(t) if b exists_at t then c exists_at t & there exist spatial regions s and s’ where & b spatially_projects_onto s at t& c is occupies_spatial_region s’ at t& s is a proper_continuant_part_of s’ at t [XXX-001"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> "occurs in"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/178>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000035>))
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/180>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> (contains process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> "contains-process")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> "containsProcess")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> "[copied from inverse property 'occurs in'] b occurs_in c =def b is a process and c is a material entity or immaterial entity& there exists a spatiotemporal region r and b occupies_spatiotemporal_region r.& forall(t) if b exists_at t then c exists_at t & there exist spatial regions s and s’ where & b spatially_projects_onto s at t& c is occupies_spatial_region s’ at t& s is a proper_continuant_part_of s’ at t [XXX-001")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> "contains process"@en)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/180>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>))
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/178>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000067> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000035>))

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> (specifically depends on at all times)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "s-depends-on_at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "specificallyDependsOn")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "A pain s-depends_on the organism that is experiencing the pain"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "a gait s-depends_on the walking object. (All at some specific time.)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "a shape s-depends_on the shaped object"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of a dependent continuant on an independent continuant: an instance of headache s-depends_on some head"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of a dependent continuant on an independent continuant: an instance of temperature s-depends_on some organism"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of a process on something: a process of cell death s-depends_on a cell"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of a process on something: an instance of seeing (a relational process) s-depends_on some organism and on some seen entity, which may be an occurrent or a continuant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of one occurrent on another: a process of answering a question is dependent on a prior process of asking a question"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of one occurrent on another: a process of obeying a command is dependent on a prior process of issuing a command"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of one occurrent on multiple independent continuants: a relational process of hitting a ball with a cricket bat"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "one-sided s-dependence of one occurrent on multiple independent continuants: a relational process of paying cash to a merchant in exchange for a bag of figs"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "reciprocal s-dependence between occurrents: a process of buying and the associated process of selling"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "reciprocal s-dependence between occurrents: a process of increasing the volume of a portion of gas while temperature remains constant and the associated process of  decreasing the pressure exerted by the gas"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "reciprocal s-dependence between occurrents: in a game of chess the process of playing with the white pieces is mutually dependent on the process of playing with the black pieces"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "the one-sided dependence of an occurrent on an independent continuant: football match on the players, the ground, the ball"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "the one-sided dependence of an occurrent on an independent continuant: handwave on a hand"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "the three-sided reciprocal s-dependence of the hue, saturation and brightness of a color [45"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "the three-sided reciprocal s-dependence of the pitch, timbre and volume of a tone [45"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "the two-sided reciprocal s-dependence of the roles of husband and wife [20"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "BFO 2 Reference: An entity – for example an act of communication or a game of football – can s-depends_on more than one entity. Complex phenomena for example in the psychological and social realms (such as inferring, commanding and requesting) or in the realm of multi-organismal biological processes (such as infection and resistance), will involve multiple families of dependence relations, involving both continuants and occurrents [1, 4, 28"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "BFO 2 Reference: S-dependence is just one type of dependence among many; it is what, in the literature, is referred to as ‘existential dependence’ [87, 46, 65, 20"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "BFO 2 Reference: the relation of s-depends_on does not in every case require simultaneous existence of its relata. Note the difference between such cases and the cases of continuant universals defined historically: the act of answering depends existentially on the prior act of questioning; the human being who was baptized or who answered a question does not himself depend existentially on the prior act of baptism or answering. He would still exist even if these acts had never taken place."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance-level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'specifically depends on at all times@en' is: forall(t) exists_at(x,t) -> exists_at(y,t) and 'specifically depends on@en(x,y,t)'.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "BFO2 Reference: specifically dependent continuant\\; process; process boundary")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "To say that b s-depends_on a at t is to say that b and c do not share common parts & b is of its nature such that it cannot exist unless c exists & b is not a boundary of c and b is not a site of which c is the host [64"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/052-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "If b is s-depends_on something at some time, then b is not a material entity. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [052-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/136-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "If b s-depends_on something at t, then there is some c, which is an independent continuant and not a spatial region, such that b s-depends_on c at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [136-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/015-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "If occurrent b s-depends_on some independent continuant c at t, then b s-depends_on c at every time at which b exists. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [015-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/013-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "an entity does not s-depend_on any of its (continuant or occurrent) parts or on anything it is part of. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [013-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/054-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "if b s-depends_on c at t & c s-depends_on d at t then b s-depends_on d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [054-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/013-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "(forall (x y t) (if (and (Entity x) (or (continuantPartOfAt y x t) (continuantPartOfAt x y t) (occurrentPartOf x y) (occurrentPartOf y x))) (not (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t)))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [013-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/015-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "(forall (x y t) (if (and (Occurrent x) (IndependentContinuant y) (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t)) (forall (t_1) (if (existsAt x t_1) (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t_1))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [015-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/136-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "(forall (x y t) (if (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t) (exists (z) (and (IndependentContinuant z) (not (SpatialRegion z)) (specificallyDependsOnAt x z t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [136-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/054-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "(forall (x y z t) (if (and (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t) (specificallyDependsOnAt y z t)) (specificallyDependsOnAt x z t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [054-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/052-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "(forall (x) (if (exists (y t) (specificallyDependsOnAt x y t)) (not (MaterialEntity x)))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [052-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> "specifically depends on at all times"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000169>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> (located in at all times)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "located-in_at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "locatedInAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "Mary located_in Salzburg"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "the Empire State Building located_in New York."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "this portion of cocaine located_in this portion of blood"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "this stem cell located_in this portion of bone marrow"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "your arm located_in your body"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/045-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "b located_in c at t = Def. b and c are independent continuants, and the region at which b is located at t is a (proper or improper) continuant_part_of the region at which c is located at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [045-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance-level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'located in at all times@en' is: forall(t) exists_at(x,t) -> exists_at(y,t) and 'located in@en(x,y,t)'.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "BFO2 Reference: independent continuant")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/046-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "Located_in is transitive. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [046-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/048-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "for all independent continuants b, c, and d:  if b continuant_part_of c at t & c located_in d at t, then b located_in d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [048-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/049-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "for all independent continuants b, c, and d:  if b located_in c at t & c continuant_part_of d at t, then b located_in d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [049-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/048-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "(forall (x y z t) (if (and (IndependentContinuant x) (IndependentContinuant y) (IndependentContinuant z) (continuantPartOfAt x y t) (locatedInAt y z t)) (locatedInAt x z t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [048-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/049-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "(forall (x y z t) (if (and (IndependentContinuant x) (IndependentContinuant y) (IndependentContinuant z) (locatedInAt x y t) (continuantPartOfAt y z t)) (locatedInAt x z t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [049-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/046-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "(forall (x y z t) (if (and (locatedInAt x y t) (locatedInAt y z t)) (locatedInAt x z t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [046-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/045-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "(iff (locatedInAt a b t) (and (IndependentContinuant a) (IndependentContinuant b) (exists (r_1 r_2) (and (occupiesSpatialRegionAt a r_1 t) (occupiesSpatialRegionAt b r_2 t) (continuantPartOfAt r_1 r_2 t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [045-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> "located in at all times"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000171>)
TransitiveObjectProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000082>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> (occupies spatial region at some time)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "located-at-r_st")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "occupiesSpatialRegionAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'occupies spatial region at some time@en' is: exists t,  exists_at(x,t) & exists_at(y,t) & 'occupies spatial region@en'(x,y,t)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "BFO2 Reference: independent continuant")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "BFO2 Reference: spatial region")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/041-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "b occupies_spatial_region r at t means that r is a spatial region in which independent continuant b is exactly located (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [041-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/042-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "every region r is occupies_spatial_region r at all times. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [042-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/043-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000601> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "if b occupies_spatial_region r at t & b continuant_part_of b at t, then there is some r which is continuant_part_of r at t such that b  occupies_spatial_region r at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [043-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/042-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "(forall (r t) (if (Region r) (occupiesSpatialRegionAt r r t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [042-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/041-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "(forall (x r t) (if (occupiesSpatialRegionAt x r t) (and (SpatialRegion r) (IndependentContinuant x)))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [041-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/043-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "(forall (x y r_1 t) (if (and (occupiesSpatialRegionAt x r_1 t) (continuantPartOfAt y x t)) (exists (r_2) (and (continuantPartOfAt r_2 r_1 t) (occupiesSpatialRegionAt y r_2 t))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [043-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> "occupies spatial region at some time"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000123>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/041-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000004>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/516>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000006>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> (disposition of at all times)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "d-of_at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "dispositionOfAt")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/066-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "a disposition_of b at t =Def. a is a disposition and a inheres_in b at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [066-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance-level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'disposition of at all times@en' is: forall(t) exists_at(x,t) -> exists_at(y,t) and 'disposition of@en(x,y,t)'.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/066-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "(iff (dispositionOf a b t) (and (Disposition a) (inheresInAt a b t))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [066-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> "disposition of at all times"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000052>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/525>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000107> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> (exists at)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "exists-at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "existsAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "BFO2 Reference: entity")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "BFO2 Reference: temporal region")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/118-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "b exists_at t means: b is an entity which exists at some temporal region t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [118-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> "exists at"@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000157>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/101>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/102>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000008>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> (has material basis at all times)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "has-material-basis_at")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "hasMaterialBasisAt")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "the material basis of John’s disposition to cough is the viral infection in John’s upper respiratory tract"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "the material basis of the disposition to wear unevenly of John’s tires is the worn suspension of his car."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "Alan Ruttenberg: This is a binary version of a ternary time-indexed, instance-level, relation. The BFO reading of the binary relation 'has material basis at all times@en' is: forall(t) exists_at(x,t) -> exists_at(y,t) and 'has material basis@en(x,y,t)'.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/071-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "b has_material_basis c at t means: b is a disposition & c is a material entity & there is some d bearer_of b at t& c continuant_part_of d at t& d has_disposition b at t because c continuant_part_of d at t. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [071-002])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/071-002>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "(forall (x y t) (if (hasMaterialBasisAt x y t) (and (Disposition x) (MaterialEntity y) (exists (z) (and (bearerOfAt z x t) (continuantPartOfAt y z t) (exists (w) (and (Disposition w) (if (hasDisposition z w) (continuantPartOfAt y z t))))))))) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [071-002] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> "has material basis at all times"@en)
ObjectPropertyDomain(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/531>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016>)
ObjectPropertyRange(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/0000602>) Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/532>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> (has occurrent part)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000179> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "o-has-part")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000180> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "hasOccurrentPart")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] Mary’s 5th birthday occurrent_part_of Mary’s life")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] The process of a footballer’s heart beating once is an occurrent part but not a temporal_part of a game of football.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] the first set of the tennis match occurrent_part_of the tennis match.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/007-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "b has_occurrent_part c = Def. c occurrent_part_of b. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [007-001])"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] BFO 2 Reference: a (continuant or occurrent) part of itself. We appreciate that this is counterintuitive for some users, since it implies for example that President Obama is a part of himself. However it brings benefits in simplifying the logical formalism, and it captures an important feature of identity, namely that it is the limit case of mereological inclusion.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] BFO2 Reference: occurrent")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "[copied from inverse property 'part of occurrent'] b occurrent_part_of c =Def. b is a part of c & b and c are occurrents. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [003-002])")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0010000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/007-001>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "(iff (hasOccurrentPart a b) (occurrentPartOf b a)) // axiom label in BFO2 CLIF: [007-001] ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000117> "has occurrent part"@en)
